{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../ChatJoinRequest/", "title": "ChatJoinRequest"}, "next": {"link": "../ChatMemberUpdated/", "title": "ChatMemberUpdated"}, "title": "ChatMember", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"chatmember\">\n<h1>ChatMember<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#chatmember\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.ChatMember\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatMember</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.ChatMember\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Contains information about one member of a chat.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>status</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../enums/ChatMemberStatus/#pyrogram.enums.ChatMemberStatus\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.ChatMemberStatus\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatMemberStatus</span></code></a>) \u2013 The member\u2019s status in the chat.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>user</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../User/#pyrogram.types.User\" title=\"pyrogram.types.User\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">User</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Information about the user.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>chat</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../Chat/#pyrogram.types.Chat\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Chat\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Chat</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Information about the chat (useful in case of banned channel senders).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>joined_date</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/datetime.html#datetime.datetime\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">datetime</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Date when the user joined.\nNot available for the owner.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>custom_title</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 A custom title that will be shown to all members instead of \u201cOwner\u201d or \u201cAdmin\u201d.\nCreator (owner) and administrators only. Can be None in case there\u2019s no custom title set.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>until_date</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/datetime.html#datetime.datetime\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">datetime</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Member, restricted, banned only.\nIf status is RESTRICTED or BANNED, Date when restrictions will be lifted for this user.\nIf status is MEMBER, Date when the user\u2019s subscription will expire.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>invited_by</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../User/#pyrogram.types.User\" title=\"pyrogram.types.User\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">User</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Administrators and self member only. Information about the user who invited this member.\nIn case the user joined by himself this will be the same as \u201cuser\u201d.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>promoted_by</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../User/#pyrogram.types.User\" title=\"pyrogram.types.User\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">User</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Administrators only. Information about the user who promoted this member as administrator.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>restricted_by</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../User/#pyrogram.types.User\" title=\"pyrogram.types.User\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">User</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Restricted and banned only. Information about the user who restricted or banned this member.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>is_member</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Restricted only. True, if the user is a member of the chat at the moment of the request.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>can_be_edited</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 True, if the you are allowed to edit administrator privileges of the user.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>permissions</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../ChatPermissions/#pyrogram.types.ChatPermissions\" title=\"pyrogram.types.ChatPermissions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatPermissions</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Restricted only. Restricted actions that a non-administrator user is allowed to take.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>privileges</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../ChatPrivileges/#pyrogram.types.ChatPrivileges\" title=\"pyrogram.types.ChatPrivileges\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatPrivileges</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Administrators only. Privileged actions that an administrator is able to take.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/types/ChatMemberUpdated", "ChatMemberUpdated", "N", "next"], ["api/types/ChatJoinRequest", "ChatJoinRequest", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">ChatMember</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.ChatMember\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatMember</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/types/ChatMember", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}